{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus","id":1376047,"title":"Staying Safe from the Virus","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-21T18:15:29-07:00","id":1376047,"title":"Staying Safe from the Virus","content":"Hi guys. I hope a non-Exalted post is ok with the mods. <br /> <br /> How are you all handling the Corona virus? I'm a teacher in Japan so my school was closed early (thankfully I'm still collecting salary). We (the Japanese) aren't panic buying food or anything, but masks and toilet paper are perpetually sold out. I'm lucky enough to have an 18-roll pack for myself. <br /> <br /> You guys safe? Missing anything? Have more time to game? I was able to get 2 extra sessions in, so small comfort there. <br /> <br /> Anyway, stay safe everyone and take care. I don't want to lose any of you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-21T18:41:55-07:00","id":1376049,"title":"","content":"I'm working from home. The local supermarket is completely sold out of a variety of specific things, such as bread. I'm using the time saved by not traveling to work and not socializing to try and catch up on Exalted development work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-21T19:29:03-07:00","id":1376054,"title":"","content":"My life hasn't changed much overall apart from me being more mindful and trying to keep people at a distance. Since I work at a medical clinic, I still need to check in for work. Since I don't have a car, I still need to take the bus there. My brother is showing symptoms now, though, so he's quarantined himself with his family.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-21T19:33:12-07:00","id":1376056,"title":"","content":"I can\u2019t stay at home. I mean, I\u2019ve been cleared to do so, but I wouldn\u2019t be paid for it, and my finances are not such that I can comfortably sit out a pay period.<br /> <br /> So, every night I go in to work and try and keep to myself as much as possible, washing my hands frequently, and shower thoroughly as soon as I get home.<br /> <br /> I\u2019d <i>love to</i> stay home, but I can\u2019t. <br /> <br /> I\u2019m sure looking forward to Sunday morning\u2019s Exalted session, though; we\u2019re playing over Discord.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 03-21-2020, 10:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-21T20:11:15-07:00","id":1376060,"title":"","content":"I work on the property I live in, so while maintenance has had a few alterations to how we function as the emergency call up guy my role hasn't changed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-21T20:32:03-07:00","id":1376061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1376056#post1376056\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019d <i>love to</i> stay home, but I can\u2019t.</div> </div> </div> </div>That sucks, man. My condolences.<br /> <br /> <br /> I live with my extended family, and we're sitting pretty for now. It helps that we planned ahead for emergencies like this, so we already had surplus toilet paper, food, and water bottles.<br /> <br /> I get to work from home, my parents are retired and surviving on Dad's pension, and my sister is still sharing custody of her kids with her trustfund-baby ex.<br /> <br /> Sis is enjoying the opportunity to cook at home more often, and we're all enjoying the more frequent family meals. I went and picked up chicken dinners for us all from a local favorite fast-food place of mine.<br /> <br /> Another time, she cooked a dinner so spicy I couldn't bring myself to sit at the table. The smell alone...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T00:33:56-07:00","id":1376073,"title":"","content":"I've been lucky to be able to stay home with my wife. We're both going a little stir crazy, but neither of us are suffering much otherwise.<br /> <br /> I ran a session on Saturday, and one on Friday, both Exalted 3e, both on Discord with an assist from roll20. I tried a full-social one-shot murder mystery, and got some great feedback. I hadn't hammered it into sharp enough shape, but now I know where to strike after the playtest. The other session was running some newbie Solars through their first Wyld Hunt. They were shaking in their boots, but were never in real danger.<br /> <br /> A buddy I regularly play boardgames with is down with a very bad flu, but since I live in the states he won't be tested. We have cancelled all of our regular boardgame get-togethers, and moved the roleplaying online. With all the time I have, I'll see what I can do about tabletop simulator or roll20'ing up some boardgames, most likely. After I revise the social one-shot... After I get session prep done for the next session... <br /> <br /> Really, I'll still be full of sit-at-the-computer projects even if I spend the next month sitting at my computer. So I expect quarantine to go well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T01:03:01-07:00","id":1376078,"title":"","content":"Not a mod, but you know there's an off-topic forum, right?<br /> <br /> Exalted specific? Dynasty of Dovak is back down to just the two of us. If we get isolated we might increase play frequency, but we're back to shorter sessions. We're trying to blue-book a session with Melody's player, but their wedding has been called off so they have bigger concerns right now.<br /> <br /> I'm a prepper, so I needed to grab some long-life milk and I'm going out shortly to get some fresh fruit but otherwise I'm stocked up. Things aren't that bad where I am -- toilet paper is restocked three times a day (it sells out within an hour and folks queue for it), and there's always alternatives on the shelves (Fixadent is sold out, but you can buy Polygrip; no dispersable paracetamol but plenty of Lemsip; no Thick Cut Hovis but plenty of Medium, Toastie and Doorstop). Still lots of empty shelves and not-quite suitable alternatives (I can get Sanex, my brand of moisturizing body wash, for normal skin but not for my Very Dry skin type; I can get mixed beans in tomato sauce but not mixed beans in water or normal harricot beans in tomato sauce). But as I said, I'm a Costco-shopping prepper: I'm still working through my Christmas supplies. The family aren't preppers and I fully expected to have to prop them up, but they've all been shopping sensibly and making-do with what's on the shelf. Neighbours doing fine too. [Edit] That said, just arrived at the shops an hour before they open and they're already queuing round the car park. Maybe no fresh fruit today. Still have plenty of canned goods. [/Edit]<br /> <br /> The gas war between Russia and OPMEC has been a god-send. I was anticipating fuel shortages, but this couldn't have been better timed.<br /> <br /> Like TheCount, I have to work. My sympathies to everyone else out there, but Alucard has the right of it: minimize contact, frequently clean hands, shower. Remember to change your clothes too.<br /> <br /> I don't want to get political about this but you're all in my prayers (substitute &quot;thoughts&quot; or &quot;protection spells&quot; if it makes you feel better). Stay safe Exalted forum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 03-22-2020, 04:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T01:52:17-07:00","id":1376081,"title":"","content":"I was teaching from home last week, but now I have no work. The government said that they will pay people's wages so that they don't get fired, but that's no good if you're on a zero-hours contract anyway. But people on zero hours contracts don't vote Conservative I guess, so...<br /> In the old days I would sign up for unemployment benefits, but these days you don't get any money for a month. I'm hoping my boss can find us more online teaching.<br /> Luckily I am good at saving. I live with my disabled sister, so she's used to being trapped at home.\u2639\ufe0f<br /> I can't really complain too much. Could be way worse. I have a lot of friends who work in hospitals or homeless shelters. The hospitals were already manic, underfunded places, now they're way worse. And the homeless shelters have had to close, but of course homeless people still need help, so they're working on the streets all day/night now. Our WhatsApp group is just full of requests for prayer.<br /> Oh, and my friend who works for a travel agency told me half her colleagues were fired. \ud83d\ude27 <br /> Hope/pray you all are safe, but also that you're okay financially.<br /> <br /> So, I'm fine really, for now, but in a week I'll be bored out of my mind. Going to rejoin an Exalted game I sort of dropped out of; I've played Exalted too much (almost every week for 14 years) and I am burnt out. Last character was boring and unmotivated. Couldn't think of a new one. But I had a dream about an intelligent and cunning bear, a bear wizard. \ud83d\udc3b<br /> <br /> In our other Exalted game, I have a character who dislikes and is disliked by the other PCs, who don't want him to do the plot, and who has lost an eye, arm, and 3 toes. Think I'll retire him. I got a book of Egyptian history for my birthday; the game is set in Egypt-land, so hopefully it'll give me an idea.<br /> <br /> I might also run some online games for my friends if they're bored, but I play 2 Exalted games and run 1, I'd rather do a different game. I'd like to run Only War maybe. Or DnD. Ran a short Mage game, they enjoyed that.<br /> <br /> We have run stuff over Skype, but I want to try some different platforms, because Skype isn't great. I like Discord, but it doesn't have video.<br /> What is the benefit of Roll20?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 03-22-2020, 04:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T02:39:19-07:00","id":1376085,"title":"","content":"I'm doing my thesis from home, it's ok because it's mainly research. Sometimes it's hard to get motivated because you get stuck and you got neither your colleagues nor your (dunno the English word) PhD leader to help you so it can be pretty demotivating when you hit a wall. But overall it's going good.<br /> <br /> We did some groceries last weekend so we're kinda all good. But since this is our new apartment with my girlfriend, we don't have a lost stock because we arrived last month, so we are starting to run a bit short on some things. It should be good because the nearby supermarket seems to have enough stocks, the downside is that you have to queue for apparently quite some time and I don't really wanna go outside and risk catching the Coronavirus.<br /> <br /> Thanks for the topic it's very kind of you. Hope you guys are all doing well.<br /> <br /> Edit : Also we're starting a mini-campaign with my girlfriend, she almost never played before si I hope I can give her a good experience with Exalted, since I love this game so much and she has heard me talk about it so much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":24291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","user":"Chausse","date":". 03-22-2020, 05:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T03:00:39-07:00","id":1376092,"title":"","content":"I'm a substitute teacher, and the schools aren't closing yet, so I've been benefitting so far. I might get sick, but that's a risk I'll just have to take.<br /> <br /> The toilet paper keeps being sold out, even though it basically <i>can't</i> run out; today I'm heading out to try and beat the ghouls for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":97,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","user":"The MG","date":". 03-22-2020, 05:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T03:23:43-07:00","id":1376095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1376081#post1376081\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the old days I would sign up for unemployment benefits, but these days you don't get any money for a month. I'm hoping my boss can find us more online teaching.</div> </div> </div> </div> It's worth making the Universal Credit application anyway because<br /> <br /> #1 We don't know how long this crisis will last, getting paid in 5 weeks might not seem worthwhile but if you spend a week not applying because you're holding out hope online job that means you won't get paid for 6 weeks etc.<br /> #2 You can get an advance on your UC that's repaid via deductions.<br /> #3 You can still work part-time and claim UC.<br /> #4 If you don't sign on there's no <b>evidence</b> you were financially impacted by Corona Virus.<br /> <br /> I'm a buisiness start advisor for the Chamber of Commerce in the last couple of weeks I've had to tell a lot of my clients to throw in the towel and claim UC. It's fucking depressing.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T04:20:59-07:00","id":1376098,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I think I'd better apply just in case. Thanks. I've got 3 hours of work next week, but I guess that comes under part-time work.<br /> It's a **** amount of money though. Still, better than nothing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 03-22-2020, 07:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T07:14:57-07:00","id":1376103,"title":"","content":"wow, I feel like I just got a small window into everyone's personal lives. Really reminds you that behind the screen name and the comments is a person with there own struggles going on. <br /> <br /> My Dad works at a hospital so he has to go in (he's not a doctor or nurse though, so he shouldn't catch anything), and I'm a little worries because he had heart surgery about 18 months ago. If he gets corona it would probably kill him. My mom works at church, which is now cancelled, but she's trying to set up a video feed for the old folk so they can watch mass from home (apparently you <b>can't</b> hold up your own bread in front of the camera for teletransubstatiation).<br /> <br /> [QUOTE=The Wizard of Oz;n1376081 I got a book of Egyptian history for my birthday; the game is set in Egypt-land, so hopefully it'll give me an idea.[/QUOTE]<br /> What book? I made an NPC out of Pharaoh from <i>Prince of Egypt's</i> version of Exodus. Really played up that his adopted brother was a Solar Scourge of the South. I love pharaohs and Egyptian motifs. Really underplayed in fantasy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T08:09:19-07:00","id":1376111,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1376103#post1376103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(apparently you <b>can't</b> hold up your own bread in front of the camera for teletransubstatiation)</div> </div> </div> </div>What sense does <b>that</b> make?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T10:06:42-07:00","id":1376123,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1376081#post1376081\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is the benefit of Roll20?</div> </div> </div> </div>To briefly derail, it can clarify things like positioning, onslaught penalties, mote pools, character sheets, Charms, Initiative and Initiative order, and die rolling. Here's a picture:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://lytek.org/tikor/Roll20%20Wyld%20Hunt.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T12:59:17-07:00","id":1376140,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1376103#post1376103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What book?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Rise and Fall of Ancient Egypt by Toby Wilkinson. So far looks pop history enough to be readable, but weighty enough not to be a waste of time or give me a really twisted view. Hopefully.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I made an NPC out of Pharaoh from <i>Prince of Egypt's</i> version of Exodus. Really played up that his adopted brother was a Solar Scourge of the South. I love pharaohs and Egyptian motifs. Really underplayed in fantasy. </div> </div> </div>Hah, that's a great idea.<br /> <br /> I actually went to see the musical of Prince of Egypt a couple of weeks ago. Going to London to watch a musical isn't the sort of thing I normally do, but when a couple of my friends suggested it, I thought I'd give it a go. It was really enjoyable (the way the actors used their bodies to portray scenery was really clever), and as I'd been reading up on Egypt recently I enjoyed hearing the High Priest of Ptah explaining Egyptian religious concepts, and them all singing of Seti the Great, and so on.<br /> The Pharoah Rameses was really good as well, although I found his final scene somewhat trite.<br /> <br /> Anyway, we've been playing in Sukhmet, an Egypt-expy where everyone worships the Crocodile god of the River (who may just be a big fat Sobeksis) as supreme deity, for years now. I thought as I wanted to make a new character, I should try and engage with it more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T13:00:07-07:00","id":1376141,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tikor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1376123#post1376123\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To briefly derail, it can clarify things like positioning, onslaught penalties, mote pools, character sheets, Charms, Initiative and Initiative order, and die rolling. Here's a picture:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://lytek.org/tikor/Roll20%20Wyld%20Hunt.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>That... looks pretty complicated. Though I imagine it's fine in practice? I tend to have 3 tabs open to track stuff, roll dice, etc, anyway.<br /> <br /> One of my friend plays DnD on it, she said it's easy for players but requires some work for STs to get the hang of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 03-22-2020, 04:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T13:20:25-07:00","id":1376146,"title":"","content":"So where I live in the whole corona situation is only starting in terms of the amount of sick people- but the panic in here was already strong long before it. Currently there is an official quarantine, yet it is not enforced against individuals and only against businesses. The supermarkets are full, more or less, but it doesn't stop people from buying stocks of toilet paper and food, simply because they see that people in other countries do so. We have unfortunately had our first death in here a day ago, and everyone agree that there will be more. The main issue is that we have no functional government, and as such no budget. Politics influences our ability to cope with the plague, and even the ministry of health now fights against the ministry of defense about which one should take over the issue. The worst thing is that because the quarantine is not enforced, a lot of people still go out and treat the fact that most businesses are closed as vacation, and go out with their kids and such. It came to the point that our prime minister have compared the corona to the black plague- which is an exaggeration, but if it would make people stay at home instead of coming out &quot;because we are young and that disease only harms old people so why we should even care&quot; I can take it.<br /> <br /> I personally mostly stay at home, and barely go out. As I am a theoretician and in the middle of writing my Master Thesis, I don't actually have any need to go out- but it starts becoming difficult. As I live with my mother and she is in a risk group, I need to be extra careful so I won't endanger her too, and it starts becoming tiresome. There are also issues with the internet and the television, and as such technicians need to come in and fix them, which means higher chance for a &quot;breach&quot;. It starts becoming hard to not meet up with my friends, even though I talk with them on day to day basis, and have moved all of my RPG sessions into an online format until things would clear out. Still, after more than a week closed in my home almost 24/7, it starts becoming difficult. Unfortunately, using a &quot;worst case scenario&quot; and exponential fitting, I can see that we have around 40 days until the plague would reach its peak, but that is because we are yet to see the effect of the quarantine (response time of around a week, and all of that).<br /> <br /> In short- it is difficult in here, the worst is still ahead, but for now we hope for the best and manage to get along.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T16:32:10-07:00","id":1376170,"title":"","content":"I'm currently working at a gas station while I finish up my Masters degree. We've been deemed &quot;essential personnel&quot; so they're not shutting us down. We had 2 people quit so I've been working mad overtime (did 63 hours last week and I'm looking at 70 this week), which is a huge pain in the butt. Fortunately my college shut down and it'll be awhile before they can get these classes set up to take them online. Plus really, I can't complain too much since at least I've still got a job. A ton of people I know in the service industry have had their hours slashed to nothing (5 or less) or were just laid off entirely and there's no guarantee the places they worked will be reopen or will rehire them.<br /> <br /> Other than that, been washing my hands when I can between customers and hoping I don't get the stupid virus, but that's about all I can do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-23T12:43:47-07:00","id":1376291,"title":"","content":"In Poland, we are after second week of public quarantine. Public gatherings, restaurants, theaters, cinemas are closed. Same are schools, kindergartens and any work office that can go for <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Telecommuting\" target=\"_blank\">home office and telework</a>. Supermarkets are limited in number of people that can be in it, in some are hand sensitizers. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I live all 24 hours with my life partner now, in our house in smaller town in our province. Nearby us was first epidemic case in province, few kilometers away in next town, we go twice a week. We had first patients half kilometer away in our hospital. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> But now epidemic is everywhere, so we are all on the same footing as rest of country.<br /> <br /> I limit to minimum contacts with my family, as feel a bit sick - probably only flu. Especially limit contacts with my older parents, as they are on the high risk group. With partner we only goes to supermarket three times a week, to one with hand senetizer.<br /> <br /> As to work - I do tasks from home office as IT technician and app tester on our company servers. My partner is private English teacher - he run lessons over Skype, Messenger and Discord now. ( I configured for him, off course. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> My older mother also, so she can call to her grandkids on epidemic. )<br /> <br /> Now, having all this time, I'm happy to see him - on normal day-to-day we only have few hours for us a week, now we finally live together. With all the free time, I continue my to tabletops games on Roll20 - our <b>Pirates of Pugmire</b> campaign ( on <b>D&amp;D</b> 5E sheets ) and our Viking <b>Werewolf: the Forsaken</b> game in Byzantine Empire ( on my own CharSheets pack I want to publish for <b>CoD </b>when ending it ). <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-23-2020, 03:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-24T18:40:57-07:00","id":1376460,"title":"","content":"I hate that I even feel this needs to be said, but if you want to stay safe, <i>don\u2019t listen to the President</i>. He was suggesting everyone showing up for church on Easter Sunday.<br /> <br /> Don\u2019t do that.<i> Don\u2019t do it. </i>There\u2019s already been cases of the virus having been transmitted via holy water.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-25T15:00:09-07:00","id":1376617,"title":"","content":"Meanwhile in here, all prayer houses have been closed, and prayer is allowed only in open places and with proper social distancing. Don't know how much it would help, but we can hope- the different ministries of defense, health and treasury still fight with each other about how to handle the crises, and we have already reached the exponential growth stage. The thing is that a week ago I have decided to try and predict the number of new infected using a graph- and unfortunately, it works. According to my calculation, my country is going to have more than 10,000 sick people, and people still act as they are in vacation instead of an emergency. I can see what is going to happen, but I can't do anything to stop it, which is a terrible feeling. But I feel like the unknown was worse, so I hope that whatever my government does would make my calculation fail. Otherwise, things are going to be really bad in here in around 30 days...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-27T16:51:31-07:00","id":1376869,"title":"","content":"I'm doing ok. I was off work last week, and starting this week they've let me work remotely. So I've been lucky enough to be able to do that. My wife still has to go in (we work at the same place), but they've started staggering shifts to limit amount of people there at once.<br /> <br /> Anyway, we're all doing ok so far. I hope everyone else is doing ok...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-27T23:35:48-07:00","id":1376921,"title":"","content":"My classes start up again in April but I was told -as a health precaution- not to do group or pair activities. <br /> <br /> <b>In Elementary School </b><br /> <br /> yeah buddy I dunno what to tell you, 30 kids in a small room all about a foot away from each other for 8 hours, 5 days a week, is gonna spread viruses and pair or group work isn't gonna change that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-28T00:21:27-07:00","id":1376925,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24\" data-vbnamecard=\"24\">Mr Gone</a>, great to hear you are fine! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8830_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8830\" data-vbnamecard=\"8830\">Sorcerous Overlord</a>, I just cannot imagine running lessons in Elementary Schools now! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Beside working and running online games - I commit quarantine time for electronic sheets making for Roll20 - I make <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> sheet pack - and I almost then if it's on the stricture of it only. I based them on all the <b>CoD</b> sheets I proposed to <b>Mr Gone</b> till this day. Only some CSS issues and letting to show only one page at once ( instead of all of them as we are now ) and we are golden. I will start topic on this on <b>CoD</b> forum. <br /> <br /> Here are some sneak peak - and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1376923-roll20-cod-sheets-pack\">here is topic for them</a> :<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://imgur.com/HqIMgzL\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HqIMgzL.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-28T11:58:19-07:00","id":1376978,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> Glad you're doing ok too! And the electronic sheets look really cool! Nice work!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-28T22:21:49-07:00","id":1377087,"title":"","content":"Let\u2019s just make sure when we get through this, that we remember all the people who got us here, and the people who were <i>trying</i> to get us out, and make sure we vote accordingly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-02T06:20:14-07:00","id":1377940,"title":"","content":"Had I my druthers, every rich person who fled via private jet to their personal island or remote cabin or walled compound with armed guards, would not be allowed <i>back</i> after the pandemic.<br /> <br /> \u200b(And if they wanted to use their money to cut to the front of the line when a vaccine is inevitably developed, well, I'd have some very not-nice words for them.)<br /> <br /> \u200bI know a lot of talking heads on the right are advocating <i>right now</i> that we return to work as soon as possible, for the good of the economy, even if many of us die as a result. I don't see how they don't see millions of us dying <i>not being good for the economy either</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 04-02-2020, 09:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-02T07:47:11-07:00","id":1377945,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1377940#post1377940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Had I my druthers, every rich person who fled via private jet to their personal island or remote cabin or walled compound with armed guards, would not be allowed <i>back</i> after the pandemic.<br /> <br /> \u200b(And if they wanted to use their money to cut to the front of the line when a vaccine is inevitably developed, well, I'd have some very not-nice words for them.)<br /> <br /> \u200bI know a lot of talking heads on the right are advocating <i>right now</i> that we return to work as soon as possible, for the good of the economy, even if many of us die as a result. I don't see how they don't see millions of us dying <i>not being good for the economy either</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's funny they call themselves Christians - for lots of reasons, really - because they seem to subscribe to a particularly mystical strain of Voodoo Economics.<br /> <br /> They worship &quot;The Economy&quot; as a nebulous concept, without really understanding how it works, and seeming surprised when reckless exploitation and deregulation causes the capitalist system to buckle when put under pressure. Not comprehending that, for as bad as things could get for the market under quarantine, it could get so much worse if the virus were allowed to ravage the population uncontested.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-07T08:17:53-07:00","id":1379255,"title":"","content":"I'm two days into isolation after developing a fever and suffering some pretty serious fatigue.<br /> Obviously, we don't know if it's Covid but this is easily the dryest flu I've ever had. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-07T08:44:14-07:00","id":1379259,"title":"","content":"Stay safe, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar7_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"7\" data-vbnamecard=\"7\">Lioness</a>.<br /> <br /> In other news: God<b>damn</b> it, <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2020/4/4/21207927/5g-towers-burning-uk-coronavirus-conspiracy-theory-link\" target=\"_blank\">cell phone towers <i>are not</i> spreading the virus.</a> Do not burn them!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 04-07-2020, 06:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-08T15:56:51-07:00","id":1379537,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1379255#post1379255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm two days into isolation after developing a fever and suffering some pretty serious fatigue.<br /> Obviously, we don't know if it's Covid but this is easily the dryest flu I've ever had.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh no! Hopefully it's nothing though... but, try to stay safe!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-08T16:24:33-07:00","id":1379544,"title":"","content":"I came into contact with someone Monday who tested positive today, so now <i>I'm</i> in isolation...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-08T19:46:52-07:00","id":1379583,"title":"","content":"I'm sorry to hear that, hoping you didn't get infected. Nearly everyone I know is handling it responsibly but there's a couple people who are just 'I get it, I get it' I wouldn't mind if they weren't ignoring the whole 'I get it, you get it' aspect of that mindset.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-08T21:37:36-07:00","id":1379607,"title":"","content":"Anyone want to suggest five or so Switch games to consume in the meantime? I\u2019m already three seasons into <i>Star Trek: DS9</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-08T22:31:57-07:00","id":1379638,"title":"","content":"The new Animal Crossing seems really popular.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-12T06:02:41-07:00","id":1380630,"title":"","content":"Have a safe Easter everyone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-12T19:47:14-07:00","id":1380832,"title":"","content":"There is big sale on Nintendo eShop. In Easter spirit, I bought <b>Mario+Rabbids</b>, X-COM like strategy mixing Mario world with Rabbids franchise - cause Rabbits are symbol of (old pagan) Easter. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ( And it's cool game, really cool... )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-13T18:25:09-07:00","id":1381163,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://fivethirtyeight.com/features/a-comic-strip-tour-of-the-wild-world-of-pandemic-modeling/\" target=\"_blank\">A glimpse into the world of pandemic modeling</a>, courtesy of <a href=\"http://smbc-comics.com\" target=\"_blank\">Zach Weinersmith</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-14T05:25:32-07:00","id":1381287,"title":"","content":"I'm in China and also a local, staying in the home all the day as much as possible, always wearing mask when you go out, washing your hands when you go home, that's it.<br /> <br /> To be honest I didn't be dangerous when virus is furious, and the hardest time had passed, schools and companies are getting back to work","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-14T13:27:57-07:00","id":1381422,"title":"","content":"So it looks like the government in here decided that we managed to flatten the curve for long enough, and that the quarantine should be removed next week. Whatever. As I actually can work from home at all time, I think I will wait for two weeks after the quarantine will be removed and see how things go, as most models predict that such an action would lead to a second outburst.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-14T13:38:18-07:00","id":1381425,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1381422#post1381422\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So it looks like the government in here decided that we managed to flatten the curve for long enough, and that the quarantine should be removed next week.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm reminded of that bit in <i>Dragonball Z Abridged</i> where the orange-clad man-child thinks it's a good idea to just sit back and let Freeza power up to 100%, while King Kai can only scream &quot;No! No! No!&quot; telepathically from his tiny planet, helpless to convince the stubborn ape that this posturing is going to get people killed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 04-14-2020, 05:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-15T06:30:24-07:00","id":1381630,"title":"","content":"I understand now how domestic violence is on the rise in Lockdown. I bought wireless keyboard to work from home and my life partner mocking me whole morning on how was this needless buy. He is irritating me so much, I really got some aggressive reflexes. Nothing really serious, more like neurotic jokes myself - but I clearly can see why werewolves at First Change can accidently kill his loved ones. Or that in <b>WtF</b> should be 'Bad Jokes' as Kuruth Triggers category. \ud83d\ude0e","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-15-2020, 02:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-21T07:26:28-07:00","id":1382971,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2020/04/20/opinion/coronavirus-testing-pneumonia.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.nytimes.com/2020/04/20/o...pneumonia.html</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2020/04/20/opinion/coronavirus-testing-pneumonia.html\" target=\"_blank\">L</a>etter to the NYTimes from Dr. Richard Levitan explaining how you can detect COVID-based pneumonia before you need a ventilator by using a pulse oximeter (measures blood oxygen levels), avaiable over the counter at pharmacies. Check with your doctor on how to interpret results though. I just bought one from walmart.com for $30. If you can afford it, I'd buy one for your house too.<br /> <br /> I am not a bot. I just think it's important to spread this around to give hospitals an early warning system and save lives and equipment. If you detect the pneumonia early enough, he says many can recover with oxygen therapy and proper positioning alone","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-21T07:28:30-07:00","id":1382972,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1379255#post1379255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm two days into isolation after developing a fever and suffering some pretty serious fatigue.<br /> Obviously, we don't know if it's Covid but this is easily the dryest flu I've ever had.</div> </div> </div> </div>sorry to spam, but if you're still feeling bad and a relative has a pulse oximeter lying around, ask your GP about how often you should check your Blood oxygen levels","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-22T04:36:33-07:00","id":1383121,"title":"","content":"Aside from my chest hurting like hell from all the coughing I'm all clear now, but thank you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-22T17:44:56-07:00","id":1383250,"title":"","content":"Going in to work again tonight after two weeks at home.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-23T18:54:45-07:00","id":1383494,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s kinda nice that [places] are checking the employees\u2019 temperatures and asking them health questions before they clock in, and not counting it against their attendance when they\u2019re sick. But I\u2019m kinda pissed that this wasn\u2019t <i>always</i> the case.<br /> <br /> I know enough people who had to go into work sick and beat themselves up about the possibility of infecting their coworkers. It really annoys me that it took a fucking epidemic for [the bigwigs running things] to realize that incentivizing employees to go in when they\u2019re sick was a bad move.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 04-23-2020, 09:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-23T19:43:36-07:00","id":1383501,"title":"","content":"Holy shit.<br /> <br /> <b>Do not inject disinfectant into your bodies, people.</b><br /> <br /> The President is killing people with his stupidity. -_-","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-23T20:44:50-07:00","id":1383502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1383501#post1383501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Holy shit.<br /> <br /> <b>Do not inject disinfectant into your bodies, people.</b><br /> <br /> The President is killing people with his stupidity. -_-</div> </div> </div> </div>It doesn't excuse it, but I'm hoping it was a really poorly-timed, highly innapropriate, unfunny attempt at a joke","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-23T22:22:32-07:00","id":1383512,"title":"","content":"Considering some of the other things he has straight-facedly advocated, I\u2019m not gonna make that assumption.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-24T06:57:29-07:00","id":1383594,"title":"","content":"He also apparently suggested, according to the news here, to radiate people with high intensity ultra violet light (because sunlight destroys the virus) or heat people up to the point the virus would die (which is 70 degrees Celsius).<br /> <br /> Reminds me that time when I had a medicine quiz and my group was asked how to treat a person who got infected with amoebas, and as I knew that amoebas needs water to survive, I suggested withholding water from the patient until it dies, not taking into account that it would also kill the patient. The difference is that I was a teenager, and Trump is the president of the United States of America.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-24T07:56:34-07:00","id":1383600,"title":"","content":"I sincerely feel that a sizeable percentage of the people who make it out at the end of this, will go on to have some serious misgivings about ever putting so much power in one person's hands ever again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-25T03:00:28-07:00","id":1383743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1383502#post1383502\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">It doesn't excuse it, but I'm hoping it was a really poorly-timed, highly innapropriate, unfunny attempt at a joke</span></span></span></div></div> </div> </div> </div> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">We can make jokes. The head of a major government can make jokes unrelated to the topic of the crisis at hand to maintain some moral. Even if it was not already evident from his behaviour that Trump has no reservations about throwing out wildly irresponsible advice during these press meetings, his position of responsibility forfeits the right to make jokes.</span></span></span></div> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">If he ever knew about the people consuming fish tank cleaner in response to his talk of a miracle cure, he's probably cheerfully forgotten it, when it ought to be the only thing he ever thinks about again in consideration of anything he ever says.</span></span></span></div> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1383600#post1383600\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I sincerely feel that a sizeable percentage of the people who make it out at the end of this, will go on to have some serious misgivings about ever putting so much power in one person's hands ever again.</div> </div> </div> </div>But it needs also to be remembered all of the people who look at this and cheer it on, giving the bloated mess that somehow passed itself off as a strongman every praise and excuse.<br /> <br /> Some will be sold on the narrative that the president could have done more if he only had more power, some will fall back on the narrative that even misused power is being kept out of the hands of their real enemies. Sure the single point of failure is not adequately wielding authority to prevent their parents from continuing to live their own lives and be part of yours, but at least the bad people aren't preventing new lives from being made.<br /> <br /> (Oh, incidentally, since I never seem to see it being brought up in response to the idiots who screech about adding abortion funding to stimulus bills as partisan opportunism, maybe they ought to think about the fact that <i>people confined with one another for extended periods have a much higher chance of accidental pregnancy, and this is a <b>really</b> fucking bad time to be bearing and having a baby!</i> You <i>morons!</i>)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-01T02:10:52-07:00","id":1385040,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1383600#post1383600\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I sincerely feel that a sizeable percentage of the people who make it out at the end of this, will go on to have some serious misgivings about ever putting so much power in one person's hands ever again.</div> </div> </div> </div>Giving so much power to individual people has ALWAYS been a mistake, since time immemorial.<br /> <br /> Hey, everybody remember when America had an entire revolution to stop having a king hold absolute executive power over the people? Those were good times.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-05T19:13:56-07:00","id":1385991,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bluecho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1385040#post1385040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey, everybody remember when America had an entire revolution to stop having a king hold absolute executive power over the people? Those were good times.</div> </div> </div> </div>Absolute executive power? From an <i>English</i> king? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Oh my, by the end of the 18th century they had effectively gotten to the point where those ones had stopped so much as <i>dreaming</i> that they could possess such power. Good God, George III was the grandson of some German that the House of Commons invited to the throne once they ran out of... well, Scottish kings (having already run out of the home grown variety about two hundred years before that).<br /> <br /> I'm not even gonna get into opinions on the American Revolution, just saying that absolutism is definitively barking up the wrong tree on that count.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":158,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","user":"Isator Levi","date":". 05-05-2020, 10:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-07T00:54:55-07:00","id":1386305,"title":"","content":"So, for those glasses-wearers among you who still have to go in and work, I pose a question.<br /> <br /> Wearing a mask with my glasses makes them fog up <i>immediately and drastically</i>. I heard that rubbing soap on the lenses prevents that, and it <i>does</i> seem to inhibit the formation of condensation for at least a little while\u2026 but over time wearing the glasses this way makes my eyes burn painfully (not good when touching your face is a no-no).<br /> <br /> What\u2019s <i>your</i> solution?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-07T03:12:50-07:00","id":1386341,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1386305#post1386305\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, for those glasses-wearers among you who still have to go in and work, I pose a question.<br /> (...)<br /> <br /> What\u2019s <i>your</i> solution?</div> </div> </div> </div>I have a BIG face ( as I'm almost 2 meters / 6' 7' high ). I needed to make custom canvas mask. Fortunately, my mother sews as a hobby. She made me bigger mask, with bigger 'breathing chamber' - and with mask sides not adhering to the cheeks of the face. So the air comes out to the sides of my cheeks. Which significantly reduces the glasses' misting. Maybe ask someone who sews to make something like this for you?<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://scontent.frix7-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/p960x960/95938969_10214265284180902_9053642814876811264_o.jpg?_nc_cat=107&amp;_nc_sid=85a577&amp;_nc_ohc=RvLOvabzpwwAX9vfdfL&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.frix7-1.fna&amp;_nc_tp=6&amp;oh=18951d9b7e1b247d89e397f1a9028329&amp;oe=5EDA5CE6\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 05-07-2020, 06:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-09T08:53:45-07:00","id":1386982,"title":"","content":"Those of you living in Ohio, Tennessee, Texas, Oklahoma, Alabama, South Carolina, Iowa, Pennsylvania, you <i>may not get a choice</i> in staying safe from the virus. The state governments there have either expressed interest in, or have already set up, websites and tip lines where businesses can rat out to the government those employees who are afraid to return to work during the pandemic, so they can be charged with unemployment fraud.<br /> <br /> \u200bYou might be forced to choose between risking your life exposing yourself to the disease, and starving.<br /> <br /> \u200b(Incidentally, if you <i>are</i> contacted by the government and forced to return to work, it might be wisest to contact the media about it. Shame is one of the only weapons left to us.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 05-09-2020, 12:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-10T04:55:43-07:00","id":1387251,"title":"","content":"In context of World Lockdown, that made it possible...<br /> <br /> Today we made something impossible - after more than a decade (from the last time) I ended the campaign in RPG, closing the story of characters! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> These things just don't happen! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" />We played <b>Pirates of Pugmire</b>, a ship's crew consisting of two cats, a lizard, a turtle - and a crow. The characters saved their backs, scooped the treasure - and left an ecological disaster throughout the Acid Sea by releasing a huge Vortex on it. Thank you to all my players for over 10 months of adventures and playing - with bigger and smaller breaks. I want to shout - ARRRRR! \ud83c\udff4\u2620\ufe0f<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"https://scontent.fiev1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/96670777_10214324697506198_7300883085334151168_o.jpg?_nc_cat=100&amp;_nc_sid=b8aab4&amp;_nc_ohc=HhkkIAkK7fEAX9qIm7K&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fiev1-1.fna&amp;oh=3274c1d9c7f52ad2e3546ef93b94ddc8&amp;oe=5EDE5044\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> To expand - my players were on those two ships on banks of Hopewell. Few day earlier ( of game time ) they sunk the Stormheart Island by destroying weather controlling gem. They unleashed Vortex on the Sea - and great armadas of Pugmire and Mau tried to end it's destroying walk around the coasts. Players waited in the Hopewell with their treasures and got real happy end of pirates - great gold and peaceful life on islands. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 05-10-2020, 08:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T19:44:36-07:00","id":1388538,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1386982#post1386982\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Those of you living in Ohio, Tennessee, Texas, Oklahoma, Alabama, South Carolina, Iowa, Pennsylvania, you <i>may not get a choice</i> in staying safe from the virus. The state governments there have either expressed interest in, or have already set up, websites and tip lines where businesses can rat out to the government those employees who are afraid to return to work during the pandemic, so they can be charged with unemployment fraud.<br /> <br /> \u200bYou might be forced to choose between risking your life exposing yourself to the disease, and starving.<br /> <br /> \u200b(Incidentally, if you <i>are</i> contacted by the government and forced to return to work, it might be wisest to contact the media about it. Shame is one of the only weapons left to us.)</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://www.cleveland.com/open/2020/05/ohio-reconsiders-policy-of-kicking-workers-off-unemployment-after-hackers-release-code-to-overwhelm-state-system.html\" target=\"_blank\">I love hacktivism.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T05:55:10-07:00","id":1388898,"title":"","content":"If you\u2019re one of the police, if you\u2019re a member of the media, if you are a lawmaker, if you\u2019re a barber\u2026<br /> <br /> Stay safe, but keep us safe, too. Please don\u2019t comply with these gun-toting \u201cprotestors.\u201d Their cause isn\u2019t righteous - it\u2019s selfish.<br /> <br /> A human life is more valuable than a haircut or a hamburger or some dollar store crap. <br /> <br /> And if you <i>are</i> stuck inside, I know it\u2019s frustrating. But we can do this. <i>Stay</i> inside.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T09:45:09-07:00","id":1388973,"title":"","content":"Crawling out from under the cave I've been in since CB20...<br /> <br /> <b>Lioness, how are you?</b><br /> <br /> I and my immediate family are alright for now, despite the sincere best efforts of the &quot;president&quot; to do everything in his power to make the situation in the U.S. worse. I can only say that everything Alucard says is 100% true and if you don't want to DIE and maybe accidentally KILL your family and friends, please never take advice from a man who fires scientists when they disagree with him.<br /> <br /> I was furloughed on March 27th from the first real job I've ever had (2nd worst birthday present in my life). I <i>have</i> had kind reminders that they valued me and would like to have me back someday, if possible. Being disabled, I live with my mother and depend on her for everything because I can't earn a living wage, and I'm used to living in near-quarantine because most public places aren't accessible. So this isn't imprisonment or impoverishment, just a sudden loss of all routine and the therapy appointments I had lined up. I am receiving state unemployment aid, and finally my furloughed brother has been approved for unemployment as well. My poor mother is a chemistry teacher, in a state that requires ALL students to take chemistry even if they never learned to read or add and subtract, or can't speak a word of English. So her already-impossible and thankless job is now 2x as much work due to Distance Learning. Her stress is rolling over on to me and the cats, and I can't see my therapist anymore.<br /> <br /> My father is a doctor but has been able to do a lot with telehealth, and fortunately his clinic system gives doctors enough personal protective equipment. (I don't know if other staff are similarly protected.)<br /> <br /> For us it's merely unpleasant so far, but I pray for the millions who are forced to go to work without protection, or who have lost their income, their businesses, their homes, their lives... all unnecessarily. When my mother and I go for walks in the neighborhood, we are always the ONLY people wearing masks. It's a suburb, and our neighbors refuse to mask themselves. Last night we were honked at in protest of our masks. Our place of worship switched immediatedly to online live gatherings and records all of them, but I've read that hundreds of people insist on going to church in person.<br /> <br /> Our state governor fortunately cares more about human lives than corporate profit. He closed down the whole state and has been cautious about reopening anything, no matter how much people who don't believe in germ theory scream in the streets. We won't fully reopen until the new tests are being made in sufficient quantities. I developed symptoms last weekend, and my mother has risk factors, but we were both able to get tested due to the new state initiatives, and came back negative. I'm hopeful I can even resume physical therapy next week. (Warning to you all: nasopharyngeal swabs really hurt.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 05-16-2020, 04:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T12:32:38-07:00","id":1389036,"title":"","content":"Well, some good news for everyone. My work just told us that the Coronavirus is over. We were informed that they're taking away our hazard pay since the hazardous conditions leading to the hazard pay no longer exist. Their line of reasoning being that the government is telling people to reopen and it would not be doing that if there was still a deadly pandemic out there. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T15:46:46-07:00","id":1389088,"title":"","content":"@AnubisXy<br /> <br /> I wish I could live in whatever magic bubble you seem to be in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T16:10:27-07:00","id":1389095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1389088#post1389088\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">@AnubisX