 tested, mind you. <br /> <br /> Five hundred and thirty people, every one of which has COVID.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 07-01-2020, 03:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T00:20:48-07:00","id":1400251,"title":"","content":"The prefecture I live in has 1 case, and we have over a million people. We all still wear masks, social distance, and constantly disinfect because dying from a plague should not be considered a political stance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T01:00:41-07:00","id":1400261,"title":"","content":"Our state has a neat little indicator that informs us that, just today (well, the 30th), 18 people died of covid and 1186 new cases popped up. But they're gung ho on opening schools up in two months for some reason. And based on the federal government and incidents in other states I suspect these are numbers fiddled with that they're even higher but I wish I could be surprised that people aren't looking at the numbers given and still thinking, 'Hey that's a lot of infections, maybe we shouldn't be so hasty about opening schools or maybe we shouldn't sue the governor for ordering people to wear masks in public.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T02:16:15-07:00","id":1400265,"title":"","content":"Same in Poland - we have 38 millions of citizens. Yasterday alone we had over 500 new cases, 14 people died yasterday. Still, government sustain that in September schools will be open. It's INSANE, in my point of view! I need to mark we have final of presidential election campaign in two weeks...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-01-2020, 02:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T17:47:41-07:00","id":1400432,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://abcnews.go.com/US/alabama-students-throwing-covid-parties-infected-officials/story?id=71552514&amp;cid=social_twitter_abcn&amp;fbclid=IwAR0QkmS-6Q5aZF2nM1nILgEDz78_jrwGMyoyhSrDJCv7ALRlfxgo1bD6u3A\" target=\"_