ontainer\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1401669#post1401669\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's fair.<br /> <br /> \u200bAnyway, how're things going with you, Lioness?</div> </div> </div> </div>We're trying to get back to normal in the UK and hopefully won't make things far worse in the process.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-10T01:44:40-07:00","id":1402024,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1402020#post1402020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We're trying to get back to normal in the UK and hopefully won't make things far worse in the process.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unfortunately it\u2019s still a confused mess over here. I genuinely overheard some people who were convinced that taking a COVID test would make them susceptible to the influence of the Antichrist because \u201cthey wouldn\u2019t <i>really</i> stick a swab that deep\u201d unless it\u2019s a ruse to \u201cinsert a microchip into your brain.\u201d<br /> <br /> I had to leave the room after I heard that, because if I\u2019d stayed I probably would\u2019ve shouted some very unacceptable words at them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-12T15:47:53-07:00","id":1402485,"title":"","content":"So lately I see that a lot of posts about cornavirus in facebook groups get removed/ blocked by moderators for &quot;being political&quot;. Since when the existence of a disease and how to deal with it is a &quot;political&quot; issue?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-15T00:13:02-07:00","id":1402917,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://twitter.com/nytimes/status/1283119890484867076\" target=\"_blank\">In more alarming news, the Trump administration is asking hospitals to bypass the CDC and send their Coronavirus data straight to D.C.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-17T04:53:50-07:00","id":1403208,"title":"","content":"Russia hacked COVID databases in the U.S. pertaining to our pursuit of a vaccine for the pandemic disease.<br /> <br /> Georgia\u2019s governor actually forbid its individual cities from enforcing mask-wearing in defiance of the state\u2019s defiance of common sense.<br /> <br /> <i>The Houston Chronicle</i> had a solid <b>40-page</b> obituary section.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://theweek.com/speedreads/923821/white-house-reportedly-hoping-americans-grow-numb-covid19-death-toll\" target=\"_blank\">And of course the administration <i>responsible for</i> all these deaths is hoping we\u2019ll just get used to it.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-20T09:24:31-07:00","id":1403677,"title":"","content":"Going to a doctor\u2019s office today for a followup regarding the half of the toenail they removed a week ago. Even though this is <i>all I\u2019ll be doing outside today</i>, I\u2019m still rather nervous.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-21T18:10:47-07:00","id":1403916,"title":"","content":"Gee, <i>an awful lot</i> of these politicians who want us to reopen schools are <i>very</i> determined that <b>their own</b> kids or grandkids are &quot;focused on distance learning right now.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-21T20:14:34-07:00","id":1403932,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1403916#post1403916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Gee, <i>an awful lot</i> of these politicians who want us to reopen schools are <i>very</i> determined that <b>their own</b> kids or grandkids are &quot;focused on distance learning right now.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I ain't no senator's son, no.<br /> <br /> Dodging the same problem, though.<br /> <br /> Our son's been in a small private school for the past three years. This year, while they were planning on doing virtual learning, a lot of parents balked. The school is big on community, and interaction with others, and however much the teachers (or people on the internet for the last 30 years) try it's not something you can really get across well on the internet. So many people wanted their children out that the school had to furlough for the year.<br /> <br /> Which left me having to scramble for registration to a new school on Friday when the close-off date was on Monday. I'm not really sure what our state's plan is yet, they seem to be hemming and hawwing between plan B and plan C. Plan B is half the kids in class, monitored and temperature-checked, then rotated out in 3 weeks to bring the other 50% of kids in and do the same. A logistical nightmare and nothing to help kids and teachers and custodial staff. Plan C is fully online, our area having a virtual academy for all public schools. No interaction, which sucks, kids do need it. But they also need to know it's safe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-25T08:10:24-07:00","id":1404593,"title":"","content":"The Sinclair company has mandated that all the local news stations it owns will be spreading COVID propaganda this weekend, including an interview with the creator of &quot;Plandemic,&quot; a debunked conspiracy theory that blames Dr. Fauci for the outbreak.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-25T11:35:34-07:00","id":1404606,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1404593#post1404593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Sinclair company has mandated that all the local news stations it owns will be spreading COVID propaganda this weekend, including an interview with the creator of &quot;Plandemic,&quot; a debunked conspiracy theory that blames Dr. Fauci for the outbreak.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why am I not surprised with that company. Ugh... this is bad...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-15T06:16:02-07:00","id":1408341,"title":"","content":"Some responsibility from the people theoretically in charge of my safety sure would be nice right now.<br /> <br /> \u200bAnd I ain't even talking about the President, or the governors or the Senators...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-15T11:14:58-07:00","id":1408386,"title":"","content":"I'm a nurse at a major regional hospital in the southeast. Our number of in house covid patients has ranged from 18-50 (18 being after the prior high point back in April), with an average in the low 30s. I've had one colleague--an interpreter in her late 20s--die of the virus, and a doctor I work with was in the ICU for a week but fully recovered. My hospital has handled the situation pretty well overall, and the urban centers of the state have followed the governor's CDC-based recommendations. I've had to fly out to Arizona twice now to help my father, however, and it's a totally different scenario. Outside of the airport and grocery store, mask wearing is 50/50 at best. Picking up a birthday dinner at a Texas Roadhouse, the place was packed, and probably 2/3 of people walking in didn't have masks. I'm lucky my institution let me return to work!<br /> <br /> My concern is that we'll develop an effective vaccine but significant numbers of imbeciles won't take it, keeping the virus endemic in the US population, whether out of a petulant spirit of rebellion or because they think that Bill Gates is putting RFID chips inscribed with the number of the Beast in the solution (a 'theory' touted by at least a couple pastoral lunatics since March). Unreal...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12765-otto-d-fey","name":"Otto D'Fey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-15T17:09:47-07:00","id":1408423,"title":"","content":"Yeah, this whole &quot;microchip = mark of the beast&quot; is one of the most baffling stretches in a long series of baffling stretches, to me - what's a microchip under your skin going to do that a cell phone in your hand isn't <i>already</i> doing?<br /> <br /> \u200bIf there <i>was</i> a beast and it <i>did</i> have a mark, it'd probably be the Apple logo.<br /> <br /> \u200bBut <i>anyway</i> I've got some disturbing word from a friend that his job is playing dangerously fast-and-loose with its own rules about COVID; before they're cleared to work for the day, employee's temperatures are taken with a little thermometer gun to the wrist (my understanding was that it's supposed to be used on the forehead), and a couple of questions about whether you're experiencing symptoms, <i>but if you don't have a fever they just let you in, even if you've recently acquired a cough that's slowly getting worse</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-15T20:08:24-07:00","id":1408444,"title":"","content":"Unfortunate for your friend. Wear a mask, wash hands often, and don't trust your workplace to do the right thing. We had an entire clinic's staff quarantine for 2 weeks after an environmental services worker (outside agency, work or lose) tested positive after passing through the entire building doing his/her job. The stuff spreads very easily; we'll be dealing with it for a long time. Best case scenario, we're only halfway through the pandemic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12765-otto-d-fey","name":"Otto D'Fey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-16T15:19:04-07:00","id":1408596,"title":"","content":"So two of my friends came out as positive for COVID19- which sucks, but thankfully they currently don't suffer from any symptoms, and their are quite young so we hope they will go through it without any hardships. They are the first people I know personally which got infected by the virus, so it is a strange feeling, but considering that the numbers are on a steady rise (even if not an exponential one) means it is more and more likely that someone I know will get infected. The government start discussing quarentine again because that the number of infected does not slow down, so people have decided that the best solution to decrease the numbers is simply not to get checked for coronavirus even if they are sick and have symptoms- because that people have decided that it is not dangerous and that it is &quot;just a flue&quot;, and if a bunch of old people would die it is not a big deal. Also, apperently the professor which advocated for the idea that coronavirus is not dangerous in here also claimed in the past that there was no polio disease while there was an outburst in here, and that the death of some people is unfortunate yet necessery for the country to keep on going (after all, why to waste money on medicines and vaccines to treat those people when it is cheaper to let them die?).<br /> <br /> Yeah, people like that exist, and for some stupid reason, other people actually listen to them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\