 10-10-2020, 02:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-08T00:32:48-07:00","id":1417279,"title":"","content":"Each day I\u2019m dreading going back out, even knowing that my job is orders of magnitude safer than others. :-/","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-08T00:36:14-07:00","id":1417280,"title":"","content":"Oh god i&quot;M stuck in this room, the walls are closing in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-10T11:52:58-07:00","id":1417564,"title":"","content":"Just as a reminder, 1918 <i>also</i> had big bunches of people who were vocally anti-mask and attended large gatherings <i>about</i> how they didn't want to wear masks, directly contributing to surges in case numbers and such. But just like today, they were in the minority.<br /> <br /> \u200bI'd like to thank every one of you who is staying home, and also to every one of you who wears a mask when you go out to work. It's been very hard to stay optimistic, but one thing I'm glad to see is that most people want this nightmare to end, and trust public health officials about how to make that happen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 10-10-2020, 04:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-10T21:34:49-07:00","id":1417594,"title":"","content":"In Poland, we had school reopen in September. Now, we have new records of Contagion - over 5000 people daily, when in March with Lockdown it was 300 people per day. Our PiS ruled government ( which I despise because of their anti LGBT stance) had done NOTHING to prepare schools and society for Second Wave of pandemic in Fall we have now. Right now, they declared WHOLE COUNTRY as Yellow Zone and reinstated wearing masks EVERYWHERE.They also reinstated 'Seniors Hours', where only people 60+ can buy in shops. Prime Minister ( 'Premier in Polish) is talking that' we need to find new balance, with opened schools and safety measures'. Everyone knows it's reopened schools are problem of new Contagion, but government do not want to have angry parents in country. And so, they slowly and slowly reinstate Spring Lockdown elements - but resist to close schools. Myself, I give them one month untill we will have de facto Lockdown in Poland. Especially, as at 1st November we have All Hallows holiday of Catholic Church - great holiday where you travel and goes on dead family members graves in cemetery. I bet there will be rise of sicked just after those days...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-11-2020, 12:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-10T22:02:03-07:00","id":1417598,"title":"","content":"Myself, I start to crack under isolation. Our RPG group is mainly students or people university related. My partner just pass Bachelor of Arts in English degree in September, but ate all our times and nervous. Now we are having start of University Year and EVERYTHING is so wild and uncertain. So we have no two-weeks game by MONTHS now - as schedules only are made now, when Universities sort the mess with remote lectures, extra groups, etc. in pandemic. I also have all the extra stress on daily basis in relationship - last two weeks were hard on us. It's better, we are fine with partner and loving - but it made me realize that I NEED some real relations and activities outside of the relationship - if only to be able to do something and break away the next time we argue - and I would be locked in four walls with him. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1271088-i-m-30-yo-roleplayer-and-have-no-friends\">Problem is I'm over 30 years old and not have (real) friends</a>. ( See topic for details )<br /> <br /> I try to organise things to have even buddies to play in multiplayer on computer and consoles - but it's not working. I started private fan <a href=\"http://https://discord.gg/4fFqrwh\" target=\"_blank\">Discord server for Onyx Path fans in Europe</a> - but it's only mildly active. I started private Discord for multiplayer gaming on PC and consoles - but only 2 buddies joined it. As it seems, I'm just socially repulsive and alone outside my relationship. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I try to play on my Nintendo Switch, but I feel I need some REAL contact with people, outside of work - especially, with Lockdown over us in near future.<br /> <br /> I try to play <i>Among Us</i> with Polish gay bear circle on PC - but I also feel as<i> outsider</i> there, as I REALLY do not know those people outside as avatars in <b>Bears of Poland</b> Facebook group... I REALLY need face to face RPG session - but even my planned Halloween special for <b>They Came From Beyond the Grave</b> will not come before the end of this month... And, of course, players are not readying and characters for it, so I'm not even can ease my mind, working over scenario...<br /> <br /> And now it rains outside... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-11-2020, 03:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-11T04:21:05-07:00","id":1417617,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I hear Poland got some 5,300 cases yesterday. Quite frightening, I imagine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-11T22:15:51-07:00","id":1417771,"title":"","content":"To look in the context - there is portal World-O-Meter that complies various info about COVID-19 pandemic - <a href=\"https://www.worldometers.info/coronavirus/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.worldometers.info/coronavirus/</a><br /> <br /> Below page there is table that you can sort data by columns. Most important and really showing pandemic scope in countries are those on '/1M pop', showing data in context of population numbers of each country. On 'Deaths /1M pop' Poland is 81st, so closing first 1/3 of World ranking. Nothing terribly frightening.<br /> <br /> However, sudden peack was simple unnerving. And we have first teachers dead from schools by Corona now...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-12-2020, 11:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T05:47:18-07:00","id":1417796,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1417617#post1417617\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, I hear Poland got some 5,300 cases yesterday. Quite frightening, I imagine.</div> </div> </div> </div>In my country Scotland, the second wave has started and it is a very bad sign.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Positivity, spirituality, empathy and emotional intelligence coaching are some key points to get successful in <a href=\"https://thecoachtrainingacademy.com\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> life.</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26480-emritchan","name":"emritchan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T06:32:22-07:00","id":1417804,"title":"","content":"Whereas in the US the first wave never really ended. -_-","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T08:31:42-07:00","id":1417822,"title":"","content":"Everyone know that Second Wave of COVID-19 is made mostly by reopening schools and Autumn lesser sickness resistance. Two teachers from schools in Poland are dead by Corona.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-12-2020, 03:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T11:22:09-07:00","id":1417852,"title":"","content":"Pretty sure I've caught Covid. Not sure how I'll get tested though. I don't have a car so I'd need to get a ride up the testing site since pretty much all of the testing around here is drive thru. I wouldn't feel comfortable asking someone to drive me and then wait in the car for an hour or two with me, especially if I do have Covid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T12:16:08-07:00","id":1417867,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1417852#post1417852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pretty sure I've caught Covid. Not sure how I'll get tested though. I don't have a car so I'd need to get a ride up the testing site since pretty much all of the testing around here is drive thru. I wouldn't feel comfortable asking someone to drive me and then wait in the car for an hour or two with me, especially if I do have Covid.</div> </div> </div> </div>Call your local health department, they can give you information on non drive thru testing centers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T12:34:51-07:00","id":1417873,"title":"","content":"I'm stuck in this small room, and I'm going mad. Help.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T14:20:42-07:00","id":1417913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1417867#post1417867\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Call your local health department, they can give you information on non drive thru testing centers.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just got off the phone with the local community resources people. Looks like all of the testing in my city is dive thru only. Guess I'll have to borrow someone's car tomorrow morning. But thanks for the suggestion anyway! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-13T13:52:07-07:00","id":1418089,"title":"","content":"Aaaaand I drove up to the test site at 10 in the morning, the line was absurdly long, two highway exits past the testing site. I sat in line in the car in the heat then four hours later at 2 in the afterrnoon they came by and said the test site was closing for the day, even though it was supposed to be open for another 3 hours. Guess I'll try again tomorrow if my friend can lend me his car again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 10-13-2020, 04:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-13T22:26:49-07:00","id":1418146,"title":"","content":"Best of luck to ya.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-14T08:30:51-07:00","id":1418194,"title":"","content":"Yeah, that's brutal with the test sites, I imagine you'd get the runaround trying to do something with a doctor's office and eventually have to go to the test site anyways. Hope you turn out to be okay.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-14T12:45:01-07:00","id":1418233,"title":"","content":"Thanks.<br /> <br /> Spent like 4 hours on the phone. My work got me in contact with a group that is sending an at-home test kit by mail. Should be here by Friday, so that problem is solved at least. I'm feeling kind of crappy but not terrible. Just generally lethargic with a headache and a dry cough. Gonna go take a nap for bit now that everything's mostly settled, or about as much as it can be for now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-14T13:29:53-07:00","id":1418241,"title":"","content":"My life partner of 10 years need to cancel the classes where he has to go to the client, because he is afraid of driving local buses - and schools are starting to close one by one in the region. He only works remotely now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T03:18:50-07:00","id":1418791,"title":"","content":"Still doing okay, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar741_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"741\" data-vbnamecard=\"741\">AnubisXy</a>?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T09:47:25-07:00","id":1419024,"title":"","content":"Yeah, thanks for asking! I just got my test results back about an hour ago (took a week to get them, but I guess better late than never) and I do have Covid-19. I'm already feeling mostly better by now. M/T/W were kind of bad, just a nasty cough. But for some reason on Thursday night I had severe facial pain. It felt like a sinus infection and hurt so bad I was having trouble sleeping. But over the last couple of days things have improved and while I'm not feeling 100% back to normal, I am feeling fairly well. A little lethargic but it seems like the worst has passed. <br /> <br /> Fortunately work is going to give me another week off with pay, so I should be good to go after that. I'll just keep inside and avoid people until my quarantine period is done.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T22:55:23-07:00","id":1419309,"title":"","content":"So, in Poland, it looks like our health system can crash like in Spanish Flu pandemic in 1918. All the interviews in radio I listen point to it. So it moved me to change my RPG plans as Storyteller on coming months...<br /> <br /> Many of you know I run <b>Werewolf: The Forsaken</b> 'Vikings in Byzantium' game few years now. One of main plots now is that there is <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1304111-contagion-fan-your-outbreaks?p=1304126#post1304126\">mysterious magical epidemic in Constantinopole that erase beings from reality</a>. That epidemic element - called canon Contagion in <b>CoD</b> - is the problem that makes me more and more uneasy to run the game. It start to reflect reality too much in my Minds Eye and I cannot get myself to prepare the game. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> So I proposed my players to pause <b>WtF</b> game, until pandemic stabilize or die itself. In it's place I want to run <b>Scion</b> 2E <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1412385-2e-scion-series-ideas#post1412385\">Atlantis based chronicle</a>. But the problem come the same - as <b>Scion</b> is 'urban fantasty about gods in (quasi) our world', wherever I put game action in 2020, sooner or later, pandemic will come to contrast reality. So I think to start the game in 1st January 2019 and let the story be free from COVID. At least till December of 2019 in China... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Or, maybe players will start there pandemic from even happen in our <b>Scion</b>-verse? What do you think I should do with this game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-21-2020, 04:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T05:22:31-07:00","id":1419356,"title":"","content":"Or you could run it without the pandemic happening.....games are an escape from reality","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-23T17:34:26-07:00","id":1419871,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1419024#post1419024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, thanks for asking! I just got my test results back about an hour ago (took a week to get them, but I guess better late than never) and I do have Covid-19. I'm already feeling mostly better by now. M/T/W were kind of bad, just a nasty cough. But for some reason on Thursday night I had severe facial pain. It felt like a sinus infection and hurt so bad I was having trouble sleeping. But over the last couple of days things have improved and while I'm not feeling 100% back to normal, I am feeling fairly well. A little lethargic but it seems like the worst has passed.<br /> <br /> Fortunately work is going to give me another week off with pay, so I should be good to go after that. I'll just keep inside and avoid people until my quarantine period is done.</div> </div> </div> </div>Whoa! Sorry you've had to deal with it...but I'm glad to hear you're mostly ok.<br /> <br /> Try to take it easy...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-23T21:49:24-07:00","id":1419912,"title":"","content":"Ok just vomited again. This is getting out of hand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-23T22:33:44-07:00","id":1419919,"title":"","content":"So, I\u2019ve posted in another thread about the problem with the Bureau of Labor Statistics and the way they define \u201cunemployment\u201d that allows them to be able to generate numbers that make the guys in charge look good, but even that earlier post didn\u2019t factor in gig workers (like the Lyft driver who got me to work) and those whose work falls within the federal minimums (but still falls short of a <i>living</i> wage).<br /> <br /> I feel that \u201cpeople who don\u2019t have jobs that pay a living wage\u201d is a fairly reasonable definition for \u201cunemployed,\u201d after all. <br /> <br /> So, if we factored those people into the computation, the United States\u2019 unemployment rate is sitting at <b><i>54%</i></b>. <br /> <br /> And yes, the pandemic made those numbers worse, but I\u2019d like to posit that the spread likely wouldn\u2019t have been as rapid if everybody had felt safe enough financially to take time off from work and stay home to wait out the disease.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-24T01:46:12-07:00","id":1419942,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1419912#post1419912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok just vomited again. This is getting out of hand.</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m sorry to hear things aren\u2019t going well for ya, there. We\u2019re all under a lot of stress, I\u2019m hoping to see you on the other end of this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-24T02:08:23-07:00","id":1419944,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1419942#post1419942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m sorry to hear things aren\u2019t going well for ya, there. We\u2019re all under a lot of stress, I\u2019m hoping to see you on the other end of this.</div> </div> </div> </div>I... I will be alive. But I wish I&quot;m not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-24T04:56:29-07:00","id":1419961,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1419944#post1419944\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I... I will be alive. But I wish I&quot;m not.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are there any mental health resources you can use where you live? Phone calls or Zoom or anything. I'm worried about you. <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar741_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"741\" data-vbnamecard=\"741\">AnubisXy</a> Glad to hear you are getting through. How do you feel now?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-24T21:34:50-07:00","id":1420071,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1419961#post1419961\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are there any mental health resources you can use where you live? Phone calls or Zoom or anything. I'm worried about you.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar741_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"741\" data-vbnamecard=\"741\">AnubisXy</a> Glad to hear you are getting through. How do you feel now?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks for asking! I think I'm pretty much all better by this point. I have a runny nose and a little diarrhea (I found out that's one of the symptoms) but other than that I'm doing pretty well. Figure I should be good to go back to work by Wednesday or so. I feel like I got really lucky, my case was apparently extremely mild. Hope if anyone else catches it, they get a very mild case too. But it would be best if nobody does. Keep safe, wash your hands, wear your mask.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-24T22:19:17-07:00","id":1420077,"title":"","content":"Don\u2019t forget about not touching your face while you\u2019re out and about. It\u2019s very frustrating to have to run to the restroom and wash your hands to adjust your glasses or brush your hair out of your eyes (I\u2019ve needed a haircut since March or April) and then wash your hands again, but it\u2019s better than possibly getting everyone sick.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-31T13:56:35-07:00","id":1421209,"title":"","content":"Well the U.K is undergoing a second lockdown, probably going to happen sporadically in the states at some point soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-31T15:33:14-07:00","id":1421225,"title":"","content":"In Poland, we come more and more into Lockdown mode. De facto, beside going to work, it's already is active. There are rumors that in two weeks we will have full official Lockdown.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-31T18:59:50-07:00","id":1421247,"title":"","content":"I'm glad I already voted; I was worrying this whole time that I'd get exposed to COVID and have to isolate myself before I could cast my ballot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-02T03:16:00-08:00","id":1421410,"title":"","content":"The distance learning is killing me. I wasn't meant to stay in this tiny room cooped up 24 hours on end. I was supposed to spend most of the daytime outside. Doing work in the college benches and libraries.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-02T07:17:56-08:00","id":1421437,"title":"","content":"One of our directors in company is on quarantine - from tommorow I'm on remote work from my apartment study. The best luck is my work laptop just crashed. Now I'm as IT Pro fixing my own computer. \ud83d\ude01","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-02T07:39:53-08:00","id":1421443,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1421410#post1421410\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The distance learning is killing me. I wasn't meant to stay in this tiny room cooped up 24 hours on end. I was supposed to spend most of the daytime outside. Doing work in the college benches and libraries.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is there something preventing you from masking up and going outside?","signat