o take credit for getting the vaccine reserve out rather than Biden. Except it turns out the whole exercise was built on a mountain of lies to begin with because there was never actually a vaccine reserve in the first place. Really it's just one more example that shows how incredibly incompetent and corrupt the Trump administration is. Sad thing is though lots of states were excited because they were under the impression the administration was telling the truth and they were going to be getting more vaccines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-21T09:50:24-08:00","id":1432923,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://twitter.com/BBCSouthNews/status/1351574092617555973\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Of course</i> horse racing is more important to British conservatives than vaccinating people!</a> Can't even say I'm surprised.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-21T14:52:38-08:00","id":1432964,"title":"","content":"Well, it does sound like a very British thing to do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" t