e, Twitter is finally implementing a system to help slow the spread of COVID misinformation; users who say the disease is a hoax or the vaccines are dangerous (or whatever) will face incrementally increasing temporary suspensions, until the fifth occurrence nets them a permanent ban.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-03T01:00:58-08:00","id":1437769,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar177_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"177\" data-vbnamecard=\"177\">TheCountAlucard</a> Better late than nothing, Twitter...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-03-2021, 04:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-03T17:09:48-08:00","id":1437885,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1437768#post1437768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More than a year too late, Twitter is finally implementing a system to help slow the spread of COVID misinformation; users who say the disease is a hoax or the vaccines are dangerous (or whatever) will face incrementally increasing temporary suspensions, until the fifth occurrence nets them a permanent ban.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's about freaking time!!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-04T20:04:08-08:00","id":1438061,"title":"","content":"I was very saddened last year when anarchist anthropologist David Graeber died; my eternal thanks to Stephen Lea Sheppard for his pointing me in the direction of Graeber\u2019s book, <i>Debt: the First 5,000 Years</i>. I was disappointed at not just the loss of him, but at the prospect of never seeing anything new of his.<br /> <br /> Then someone surprised me today, showing me a posthumously-published essay of Graeber\u2019s about <a href=\"https://www.jacobinmag.com/2021/03/david-graeber-posthumous-essay-pandemic\" target=\"_blank\">the very pandemic we\u2019re going through.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-02T14:54:15-07:00","id":1442439,"title":"","content":"It's very frustrating that Asa Hutchinson and his ilk are lifting mask mandates, in spite of 331 <i>thousand</i> Arkansans catching the disease.<br /> <br /> \u200bI'm gonna keep wearing my masks to work, as I'm still in line for the vaccine.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-11T08:41:24-07:00","id":1443474,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1442439#post1442439\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's very frustrating that Asa Hutchinson and his ilk are lifting mask mandates, in spite of 331 <i>thousand</i> Arkansans catching the disease.<br /> <br /> \u200bI'm gonna keep wearing my masks to work, as I'm still in line for the vaccine.</div> </div> </div> </div>I got my first dose of the Vaccine at the end of March, and I get my second at the end of April. I'll probably just keep wearing my mask, especially around flu season (which honestly we should have probably been doing anyway).<br /> <br /> And yea, it's pretty horrible that a lot of states are lifting mask mandates. Ugh...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-11T10:27:10-07:00","id":1443479,"title":"","content":"Pollen fills the air so much here it's like seeing through a haze so I'm fine wearing a mask even if they lowered the mandate, I'd be fine with it even after the pandemic's over if that ever happens with all the people so eager to spread it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-11T11:12:51-07:00","id":1443482,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1443479#post1443479\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pollen fills the air so much here it's like seeing through a haze so I'm fine wearing a mask even if they lowered the mandate, I'd be fine with it even after the pandemic's over if that ever happens with all the people so eager to spread it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> huh...that's actually a good point. I wonder if mask wearing has been helping my allergies too","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-11T17:56:44-07:00","id":1443543,"title":"","content":"So I'm after second week of my COVID19 infection, <b>somehow</b> dangerous conditions now...<br /> <br /> My life partner was little 'covid crazy' WHOLE YEAR - <i>'Karol, clean with bactericide shoppings!'</i>.<i> 'Did you disinfect the door handles in the car?'</i>, <i>'You are going to leave the house WITHOUT a second face mask?'</i> <i>'You checked your blood saturation with our pulse oximeter?'</i> We tried to stick to all the restrictions there were mentioned. Do all the smart medicals on radio asked us to.<br /> <br /> I went only to work, our neighborhood supermarket, our apartment and my parents house - WHOLE YEAR, only in those places. I even not partake my friends birthdays cause there were few foreign to me people there. Running RPG online only. We were afraid we can go through COVID badly, despite our relatively young age - I have type 2 diabetes, my partner has poor health and immunity in general.<br /> <br /> And we were somehow right, unfortunately...<br /> <br /> Week before Easter, my new work collogue got me infected. As he is .a Catholic participating in the life of the church - a faith association, etc. - I suspect that he even brought it from there. First week I even was not thinking it was COVID - I was having persistent cough but felt pretty good. After 4 days of coughing I asked my General Practitioner for COVID test, as collogue pointed he has <b><i>positive</i></b> - with my result was <b><i>negative</i></b>. I was even starting to thinking that maybe I will see family on Easter - but then on Easter Sunday, I got high fever, sore aches and 'superflu' symptoms. From then on, it was only worse and worse...<br /> <br /> Over week later after Easter, and two weeks in to my treatment, I'm just starting to crawl back from place of 'I coughing so much I lose oxygen, my fever is killing me and I'm not sure they will send me to hospital any minute'. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Last two days are gradually better and better - I got this 'coughing attacks' 2-3 times a day and quickly stabilize them. Blood Saturation is still on edge on 'you should go to hospital'. And fever I only get once a day now. So it's start to look controlled, finally, at my side.<br /> <br /> And my partner just starting to major symptoms himself - with mythical 'lose of taste and smell'. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I SSSOOOO MMMUUUCCCHHH want to 'thanks' my work collogue for brought this on us two. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-11-2021, 08:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-11T20:58:33-07:00","id":1443557,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1443474#post1443474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I got my first dose of the Vaccine at the end of March, and I get my second at the end of April.</div> </div> </div> </div>I got jabbed Saturday morning - my arm was pretty sore, though I managed to <i>temporarily</i> forget about the pain... right up until I made the mistake of habitually trying to pick up an entire case of lemonade with just that arm.<br /> <br /> \u200bThen I was <i>acutely</i> aware of the pain in my arm.<br /> <br /> \u200b@wyrdhamster - your post wasn't showing up when I posted this. Oof, dude, that's awful, I'm sorry. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 04-12-2021, 12:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-14T04:21:40-07:00","id":1443862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1443557#post1443557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I got jabbed Saturday morning - my arm was pretty sore, though I managed to <i>temporarily</i> forget about the pain... right up until I made the mistake of habitually trying to pick up an entire case of lemonade with just that arm.<br /> <br /> \u200bThen I was <i>acutely</i> aware of the pain in my arm.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mine was the same way! My arm was pretty sore for like 2 days, then it eased up a bit on the 3rd day and was fine after that. But yea, it hurt!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1443543#post1443543\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I'm after second week of my COVID19 infection, <b>somehow</b> dangerous conditions now...<br /> <br /> &lt;snip&gt;<br /> <br /> I SSSOOOO MMMUUUCCCHHH want to 'thanks' my work collogue for brought this on us two. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Oh no!! I'm so sorry to hear that! Hopefully y'all will recover pretty soon. Try to take it easy as you can..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-16T04:47:03-07:00","id":1444160,"title":"","content":"I'm working from home. For me almost nothing has changed","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26777-bernhigg","name":"BernhigG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26777_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-16T13:26:54-07:00","id":1444253,"title":"","content":"<b>Wyrd's Development</b> - From Monday, I'm in hospital, on COVID rehabilitation ward. I'm here on lungs complications and oxygenating myself, to 'clear the lungs' after COVID, so to speak. One week already, It seems at least one more here to possible check out. But we will see how it ends...<br /> <br /> Watching a lot of movies and TV with my partner by using Messenger chat or Discord streaming. Gods bless for mobile internet packages! Partner is taking lightly COVID from our apartment, so at least I'm not totally alone, as he also is not working and getting healthy, bored himself, on general.<br /> <br /> At Sunday, I will also <i><b>run my first RPG session from hospital by online </b></i>( <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) in <b>Monarchies of Mau</b> - it will be interesting...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-17-2021, 01:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-17T16:55:51-07:00","id":1444407,"title":"","content":"You're a legend, Wyrd.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-17T20:35:26-07:00","id":1444434,"title":"","content":"There was a thread like this? Damn. <br /> <br /> This plague is messing up EVERYBODY. Korea had... what, 600 or so new infectees yesterday. Dunno what was the exact number- every day it\u2019s hundreds. <br /> <br /> Also,<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1444253#post1444253\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[B]<br /> At Sunday, I will also <i><b>run my first RPG session from hospital by online </b></i>( <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) in <b>Monarchies of Mau</b> - it will be interesting...</div> </div> </div> </div>Seconding what Overlord said above.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-18T01:20:46-07:00","id":1444460,"title":"","content":"<b>Running RPG from hospital <i>should not be</i></b> so much difficult than normal online play <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I only need a good Virtual Table Top platform ( I use <i>Roll20</i> ), had adventure prepared for VTT ( already done, as I run <b>Mau</b> online from apartment now second year ), microphone, headphones and internet packages. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>The only real problem is that I share the room with other patient</b>, as we will talk a lot to microphone - but I discussed it with him and he is okay with it, as long as we end to 10 PM. Once or twice maybe nurse will come to change my drip or drugs to give - but it's nothing more like bio break in online sessions, yes? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> It's (should) not be different than running online games from my living room, when I had back pains. I only lay and walk the ward in hospital all the time, not so sick, in reality, mostly bored.<br /> <br /> I'm REALLY lucky I got only this small lungs complications from COVID, with my overweight and diabetes, in general. It could have be <i>really</i> much nastier in the end for me, whole COVID sickening.<br /> <br /> And today I will <b>run first hospital online RPG</b>, ever! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ( In my life, at least. )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-18-2021, 04:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-18T12:41:22-07:00","id":1444534,"title":"","content":"<b>Wyrd's Development - <i>Run first RPG session in hospital</i>.</b> Game and plot run okay on itself - the only problem were Internet packages, I needed to fix the connection few times, losing players voices few times on Discord. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Mobile internet is not the normal ADSL by WiFi I have in home... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Beside that - RPG online session like RPG online session. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> It's doable - just have good net provider. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-18-2021, 03:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-05T17:35:15-07:00","id":1447670,"title":"","content":"Oh, look, now that millions are dead worldwide and cases are surging in India, Biden is <i>finally</i> considering waiving the patents on the COVID vaccine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://khn.org/news/rather-than-give-away-its-covid-vaccine-oxford-makes-a-deal-with-drugmaker/\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bRemember, folks, the design of the vaccine developed by Oxford was going to be released 