5,"title":"","content":"So I was in hospital with COVID from April 12 till April 21. I was released with minor caughthing and chest pains few times a day. Yasterday, I got first, gigantic headache - like half a day and last 2-3 hours I couldn't even watch new Castlevania series. \ud83d\ude14 Today is better, probably...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-20T19:56:05-07:00","id":1449166,"title":"","content":"Having been vaccinated, I wish there was an option to opt out of ads telling me to get the vaccine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-20T20:25:38-07:00","id":1449167,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1449166#post1449166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Having been vaccinated, I wish there was an option to opt out of ads telling me to get the vaccine.</div> </div> </div> </div>Trick the bots watching your every move to change the ads to something else?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-20T20:54:06-07:00","id":1449168,"title":"","content":"I just use an adblocker. My wife and I got vaccinated too, it's been two weeks now so it should have sunk in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-21T04:21:01-07:00","id":1449181,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1449168#post1449168\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just use an adblocker</div> </div> </div> </div>The easiest way","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26777-bernhigg","name":"BernhigG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26777_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-23T12:58:47-07:00","id":1449368,"title":"","content":"My daughter is medically fragile and complex, so our family has been enormously cautious over the past year. My wife and I were both vaccinated the moment we were eligible, and we still tend to reflexively wear masks when outside due to the possibility of variants. It's frankly terrifying. Fortunately, neither my wife nor I work outside the home, so we've been able to decrease our potential for exposure by limiting our movements.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25574-heinrich-mentius","name":"Heinrich Mentius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25574_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-23T22:17:11-07:00","id":1449422,"title":"","content":"The extra ward my hospital opened to handle the extra Covid patient load has returned to normal floor patient status. Unfortunately, they didn't mandate vaccination for staff, but AFAIK all the nurses in my unit got their shots when I did (January) or shortly after. We've lost so many nurses that they just gave us all a pretty significant raise to stop the bleed (so to speak), and they're offering nice pay incentives for RN's to come work for us. I moved to night shift, which in my department (Radiology) is pretty chill. But I'm also the only nurse, so if a covid patient comes for a scan and needs a nurse present, I'm it. We have good covid protocols, though, so I'm not worried.<br /> <br /> All my friends are vaccinated, so we've been celebrating our return to in person sessions this past week. It's a helluva thing to be around a table again. I think it especially helpful for one player, who lost both his parents to the disease Christmas week.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12765-otto-d-fey","name":"Otto D'Fey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-23T22:09:53-07:00","id":1453326,"title":"","content":"It angers me to no end that private pharmaceutical companies, including Gates' foundation, are doing fundraisers to buy vaccines for people in the global south, after they actively worked to make sure that the patents for these vaccines would be kept private.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-24T16:02:45-07:00","id":1457609,"title":"","content":"I got vaccinated as soon as I qualified. My girlfriend continued to resist the idea for four months after they were available. Knowing she was unprotected, I kept us both on a cocktail of vitamins to reduce the danger if she caught it. Finally, after a phone call with my mother, I insisted, successfully. She was outvoted, also by her mother, who was happy when she heard her daughter was as safe. We still take all these vitamins. They are really good for energy, cholesterol and brain-function.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-26T14:57:51-08:00","id":1471301,"title":"","content":"Well...as safe I try to play it when going out, and even though I got fully vaccinated and got the booster, I tested positive today. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I went to Disney with my mom in early December and played it super safe(well, as safe I could there anyway) and I seemed fine in the weeks after. I've only been out a few times and only seen a few people since I got back, but I woke up Christmas morning with a bit of a scratchy throat and then started feeling pretty run down by the end of the day. I thought maybe I was dealing with a seasonal allergy flare up, since I sometimes I get them around this time, but I figured I should get a test just in case. My wife went and got me an at-home test, and up, positive.<br /> <br /> Right now I don't feel horrible, but not great either. Just a bit of a scratchy throat, a little sinus congestion and a little cough. So, seems to be a mild case. Hopefully it stays that way..<br /> <br /> Y'all try to stay safe out there!!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-26T22:09:54-08:00","id":1471316,"title":"","content":"I was on Christmas in my 'in-laws' house, with my partner. His younger brother was having very persistent caught. Like I got up around 5 a.m. ( I am diabetic ) and I listened for him to caught non stop for 1,5 hour... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I even got flashbacks to this year April, with my own COVID sickness and stay at the hospital for two weeks. 'Brother-in-law' was vaccinated month or two ago, and tested in hospital earlier day and they said it's allergy. Got him allergy medicines and Fervex. The partner even said that I was a little panicking because of my concerns about his brother - because the doctors had him tested before. I said that in April my tests were negative for the first week - and a week later, when I ran out of breath and had to go to hospital - they were still 'inconclusive'. Doctors still send me to hospital, based on my breathlessness.<br /> <br /> Hopefully, on next day, 'brother-in-law' got much better after allergy medications. He mostly stopped coughing. I'm very glad for this!<br /> <br /> Myself, I recently saw a doctor on the subject, as I have long chest pain, hourly at times, almost surely from COVID in April. Doctor written my allergy medicines for 'lung relaxation' - even if I am not known to have allergies. We'll see if it helps with these long pains, post COVID.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 12-27-2021, 11:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-27T04:14:57-08:00","id":1471323,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1471316#post1471316\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We'll see if it helps with these long pains, post COVID.</div> </div> </div> </div>I hope so! Sorry you're dealing with it.. And I hope your brother-in-law is ok...<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-28T13:43:22-08:00","id":1471405,"title":"","content":"I fought hard to keep working from home, because my company has a policy of kneeling to Bolsonaro, so they always try to come with something to justify us going back to the office.<br /> <br /> My wife had to go to another state to see her mom. I'm very, very worried about her. Got something there, it seems to be a flu, but the flu is also going in a serious epidemic around here... I'm really worried.<br /> <br /> At the beginning of this pandemic the WHO was advising that any vaccine developed should be spread evenly across the globe, that the &quot;developed&quot; nations shouldn't prioritize their own populations, they should help getting shots to everywhere.<br /> <br /> This was not just for being humane. We basically transformed a lot of places into highly-efficient Variation Labs for the virus. Without cutting the spread globally it was just a matter of time until a vaccine-resistant variation appeared. I'm more sick of humanity today than of the virus, really...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-28T14:13:09-08:00","id":1471407,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1471405#post1471405\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm more sick of humanity today than of the virus, really...</div> </div> </div> </div>I hear that!! Same..<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-04T02:13:09-08:00","id":1471770,"title":"","content":"Heh, I'm fully vacinnated. Third time will be in march. Despite of it I've caught that shit two times, had 6 month laryngological dysfunctions (congestion in sinuses) and I had better only after one week resting in sea climate. Second time was less serious but it left worse suprise - heart problem and I'm a bit scared of it. Have to wait untill 19 january to visit cardiologist and make heart echo and other things.<br /> My daughter suffered from it about three times but children have different problems with Covid. She'll be vacinnated as soon as she could take it (half year too young).<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1784-werewolf43","name":"werewolf43","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1784_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"315"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-05T14:28:07-08:00","id":1471860,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>werewolf43</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1376047-staying-safe-from-the-virus?p=1471770#post1471770\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Heh, I'm fully vacinnated. Third time will be in march. Despite of it I've caught that shit two times, had 6 month laryngological dysfunctions (congestion in sinuses) and I had better only after one week resting in sea climate. Second time was less serious but it left worse suprise - heart problem and I'm a bit scared of it. Have to wait untill 19 january to visit cardiologist and make heart echo and other things.<br /> My daughter suffered from it about three times but children have different problems with Covid. She'll be vacinnated as soon as she could take it (half year too young).</div> </div> </div> </div>And that's why we should have vaccinated Africa and the non-Israel Middle East, among others. Now we have people getting fourth doses and everyone still at risk because we can't control the spread of variants.<br /> <br /> Now's a bit too late. And also a bit pointless to argue that, because in the same day I see the news of some government officials and not WHO whatnot here and there (I think it was EU) saying we should focus on vaccinating those areas (you don't say, genius), I also see the news that Netanyahu will give the fourth round to his people (while Palestine gets scraps, but have constant flux of people in and out of Israel...)<br /> <br /> I just can't stand the level of stupidity that entails.<br /> <br /> For clarity's sake: I know that Palestinians working in Israel also get the shot, but that doesn't solve the problem, it actually aggravates it in terms of variation selection. That means you have key potential spreaders that live in an unprotected area, being extensively exposed to a number of local variations while working as selectors for vaccine-resistant variants. Not vaccinating them is a risk for herd immunity in Israel, vaccinating them is a potent selective tool for the virus if their homes don't receive coverage too. For several reasons, even without the humanitarian ones, preventing them from working in Israel is unfeasible. I personally consider it almost a miracle that things like Delta and Omicron didn't came from Israel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-06T01:16:21-08:00","id":1471915,"title":"","content":"Yes but it doesn't matter. Why? Here's the answer. I was lucky and went to cardiologist yesterday. Of course my left valve does not close thanks to virus, but doctor told me something that i suspected long time ago.<br /> 1. Tests doesn't work. Maby 6% of them, I know that cause I had no smell and taste and still test was negative two times, after first disease I had antibodies so 100% Covid atacked me and still,test didn't work correct. So we have Covid infected peoples with negative tests - walking sources of disease.<br /> 2. In my country doctors are NOT allowed !!!!! to send people for tests cause it would rise the % of sick population, and despite of it the number are high. Deaths too.<br /> 3. There are still anti vaccine groups and! what she told me is that they sooner or later go to hospital and then and only then are starting to panic ,,I don't want to die help me&quot;. Idiots. Fucking idiots.<br /> 4. There is a huge group of doctors not vaccined cause they are in anti vaccine groups!!!!!! WTF?! Too late ur goverment forced them to take vaccine - they have to do it in march this year.<br /> 5. We could end this shit long time ago at the beginning - shut everything down and sit on ass for two - three weeks. But no cause economy wouldn'd survive. Fuck that, the pandemic was at their best when my employer forced us to work cause it's just a flu. Now its long game between us and the virus. I've heared that every moutation is weaker but is it too weak to left us alone? <br /> Take care of Yourself. As far as I am observing rpg community may have different opinions about world and wh